/E (Then he sneezed. Not a small sneeze. A sneeze that started somewhere behind his eyes and traveled all the way to his back legs, lifting them slightly off the floor. He looked profoundly surprised. He stared at the mug. He sneezed again. He backed up two steps, reconsidered the mug from a safer distance, and sneezed a third time for good measure.)
/Pg 17 0 R
